  "reflectionText": "Hagar set the boy under a bush in the wilderness and sat a bow shot away, weeping. God heard the voice of the boy. The angel called to Hagar from the sky, and her eyes were opened to a well of water. What is it to be heard when you had set down the child you could not bear to watch die?"
